+```
+
+#### Customers v1
+
+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/payment_methods/{{PAYMENTMETHOD_ID}}/attach \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -d "customer={{CUSTOMER_ID}}"
+```
